        "notes": "Toxicity unknown: neither fetched page makes a toxicity statement and no ASPCA page for this plant was found. Not safe by default. Temperature: RHS gives only a frost-tender rating (H1C, minimum roughly 5 to 10 C) and NC State none, so unknown. Size is RHS (about 10 cm tall, spread 0.5 to 1 m, upper value). Growth rate fast is NC State only. Interval: NC State 'allow to dry out completely between waterings, reduce further in winter'. RHS gives no rule read here. One rule only, so 14 days for a 13 cm pot stays unconfirmed. Pot and season: 13 cm pot, growing season; winter comes from the rest-season factor. Dry and wet tolerance days: no source gives any, unchanged."
